{"lessons":[{"id":"g01","num":1,"lv":"A1","en":"The verb \"to be\"","ar":"الفعل to be (am / is / are)","explain":["بنستخدم am / is / are بمعنى \"يكون\" عشان نقول مين الشخص أو حالته أو مكانه.","I مع am، و he / she / it مع is، و we / you / they مع are.","في المنفي بنزوّد not بعد الفعل: She is not tired. وفي السؤال بنقدّم الفعل: Are you ready?"],"formulas":[["I am","أنا ..."],["He / She / It is","هو / هي ..."],["We / You / They are","إحنا / إنتو / هم ..."]],"examples":[["I am a student.","أنا طالب."],["She is at home.","هي في البيت."],["They are very happy.","هم سعداء جدًا."],["Are you ready?","إنت جاهز؟"]],"mistakes":[{"w":"I is happy.","r":"I am happy.","n":"مع I بنستخدم am دايمًا."},{"w":"He are my brother.","r":"He is my brother.","n":"مع He بنستخدم is دايمًا."}],"quiz":[{"q":"She ___ a doctor.","a":"is","w":["am","are","be"]},{"q":"I ___ from Egypt.","a":"am","w":["is","are","be"]},{"q":"They ___ at the park.","a":"are","w":["is","am","be"]},{"q":"___ you ready?","a":"Are","w":["Is","Am","Do"]},{"q":"My brother ___ not at home.","a":"is","w":["are","am","do"]},{"q":"We ___ good friends.","a":"are","w":["is","am","be"]}],"p":"\\b(I am|I'm|He is|She is|They are|We are|Are you|Is it)\\b"},{"id":"g02","num":2,"lv":"A1","en":"Articles: a / an / the","ar":"أدوات التعريف: a / an / the","explain":["a / an معناها \"واحد\" وبنستخدمهم لما نذكر حاجة لأول مرة أو حاجة عامة.","a قبل الكلمة اللي بتبدأ بصوت ساكن (a book)، و an قبل الصوت المتحرك (an apple).","the بنستخدمها لما اللي بنكلمه عارف إحنا بنتكلم عن إيه: The book on the table."],"formulas":[["a + صوت ساكن","a car, a house"],["an + صوت متحرك","an egg, an hour"],["the + حاجة معروفة","the sun, the door"]],"examples":[["I have a car.","عندي عربية."],["She eats an apple every day.","هي بتاكل تفاحة كل يوم."],["Close the door, please.","اقفل الباب من فضلك."],["He is an engineer.","هو مهندس."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"She is a engineer.","r":"She is an engineer.","n":"engineer بتبدأ بصوت متحرك فنستخدم an."},{"w":"I want to visit a Cairo.","r":"I want to visit Cairo.","n":"مفيش أداة قبل أسماء المدن."}],"quiz":[{"q":"I have ___ umbrella.","a":"an","w":["a","many","those"]},{"q":"She is ___ teacher.","a":"a","w":["an","many","those"]},{"q":"He has ___ orange car.","a":"an","w":["a","many","those"]},{"q":"Please close ___ window.","a":"the","w":["an","many","those"]},{"q":"I waited for ___ hour.","a":"an","w":["a","many","those"]},{"q":"___ sun rises in the east.","a":"The","w":["A","An","Some"]}],"p":"\\ban\\s+[aeiou]\\w+"},{"id":"g03","num":3,"lv":"A1","en":"Plural nouns","ar":"جمع الأسماء","explain":["غالبًا بنزوّد s للجمع: book → books.","لو الكلمة بتنتهي بـ s أو sh أو ch أو x بنزوّد es: box → boxes.","لو بتنتهي بحرف y بعد حرف ساكن بنبدّل y بـ ies: baby → babies.","فيه كلمات شاذة لازم تتحفظ: man → men, child → children, foot → feet."],"formulas":[["+ s","cat → cats"],["s / sh / ch / x + es","bus → buses"],["consonant + y → ies","city → cities"]],"examples":[["I have two brothers.","عندي أخين."],["There are three boxes here.","فيه تلات صناديق هنا."],["The babies are sleeping.","الأطفال الرضع نايمين."],["Many children play outside.","أطفال كتير بيلعبوا بره."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"two childs","r":"two children","n":"child جمعها شاذ: children."},{"w":"three boxs","r":"three boxes","n":"بعد x بنزوّد es."}],"quiz":[{"q":"One city, two ___.","a":"cities","w":["citys","cityes","city"]},{"q":"I have three ___.","a":"boxes","w":["boxs","boxies","box"]},{"q":"The ___ are playing outside.","a":"children","w":["childs","childes","child"]},{"q":"Two ___ are standing there.","a":"men","w":["mans","mens","man"]},{"q":"My ___ hurt after walking.","a":"feet","w":["foots","feets","foot"]},{"q":"She bought five ___.","a":"books","w":["bookes","bookies","book"]}],"p":"\\b(children|men|feet|people|babies|boxes|tickets)\\b"},{"id":"g04","num":4,"lv":"A1","en":"Present simple","ar":"المضارع البسيط","explain":["بنستخدمه للعادات والحقايق: I work every day. / The sun rises in the east.","مع he / she / it بنزوّد s على الفعل: She works. وبعد s و sh و ch و x نزوّد es: He watches TV.","كلمات بتدل عليه: always, usually, often, sometimes, never, every day."],"formulas":[["I / You / We / They + verb","I work"],["He / She / It + verb + s","She works"],["always / usually / never","قبل الفعل الأساسي"]],"examples":[["I drink tea every morning.","بشرب شاي كل صباح."],["She works in a bank.","هي بتشتغل في بنك."],["He watches the news at night.","هو بيتفرج على الأخبار بالليل."],["We usually eat at home.","إحنا غالبًا بنأكل في البيت."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"She work in a bank.","r":"She works in a bank.","n":"مع she بنزوّد s."},{"w":"He go to school.","r":"He goes to school.","n":"go بتبقى goes مع he / she / it."}],"quiz":[{"q":"She ___ to work by bus.","a":"goes","w":["go","going","gone"]},{"q":"They ___ football on Fridays.","a":"play","w":["plays","playing","to play"]},{"q":"He ___ tea every morning.","a":"drinks","w":["drink","drinking","to drink"]},{"q":"My mother ___ in a hospital every day.","a":"works","w":["work","working","to work"]},{"q":"I usually ___ breakfast at seven.","a":"have","w":["has","having","to have"]},{"q":"The sun ___ in the east.","a":"rises","w":["rise","rising","to rise"]}],"p":"\\b(She|He) (?!is\\b|was\\b|has\\b|does\\b|as\\b)\\w+s\\b"},{"id":"g05","num":5,"lv":"A1","en":"Present simple: negatives & questions","ar":"المضارع البسيط: النفي والسؤال","explain":["عشان ننفي بنستخدم don't مع I / you / we / they، و doesn't مع he / she / it، والفعل يرجع للأصل من غير s.","عشان نسأل بنحط Do / Does في أول الجملة: Do you like tea? Does she work here?","بعد does الفعل بيفضل في الأصل: Does he play? (مش plays)."],"formulas":[["I don't + verb","I don't know"],["She doesn't + verb","She doesn't know"],["Do / Does + subject + verb?","Does he know?"]],"examples":[["I don't like coffee.","أنا مش بحب القهوة."],["She doesn't live here.","هي مش بتسكن هنا."],["Do you speak English?","بتتكلم إنجليزي؟"],["Does he work on Fridays?","هو بيشتغل أيام الجمعة؟"]],"mistakes":[{"w":"He doesn't likes tea.","r":"He doesn't like tea.","n":"بعد doesn't الفعل في الأصل."},{"w":"Do she work here?","r":"Does she work here?","n":"مع she بنستخدم Does."}],"quiz":[{"q":"She ___ like spicy food.","a":"doesn't","w":["don't","isn't","not"]},{"q":"___ you play football?","a":"Do","w":["Does","Are","Is"]},{"q":"___ he work here?","a":"Does","w":["Do","Is","Are"]},{"q":"I ___ know the answer.","a":"don't","w":["doesn't","not","isn't"]},{"q":"Does she ___ English?","a":"speak","w":["speaks","speaking","spoke"]},{"q":"They ___ live in Cairo.","a":"don't","w":["doesn't","isn't","aren't"]}],"p":"\\b(doesn't|don't|Do you|Does)\\b"},{"id":"g06","num":6,"lv":"A1","en":"There is / There are","ar":"There is / There are","explain":["there is مع المفرد وغير المعدود، و there are مع الجمع.","للنفي: there isn't / there aren't. وللسؤال: Is there...? / Are there...?","بنستخدمها نقول إن حاجة موجودة في مكان."],"formulas":[["There is + singular","There is a park."],["There are + plural","There are two parks."],["Is / Are there ...?","Is there a bank?"]],"examples":[["There is a bank near here.","فيه بنك قريب من هنا."],["There are three rooms.","فيه تلات أوض."],["There isn't any milk.","مفيش لبن."],["Are there any shops?","فيه محلات؟"]],"mistakes":[{"w":"There is two chairs.","r":"There are two chairs.","n":"chairs جمع فنستخدم are."},{"w":"Is there any shops?","r":"Are there any shops?","n":"shops جمع فنستخدم Are."}],"quiz":[{"q":"There ___ a cat in the garden.","a":"is","w":["are","am","be"]},{"q":"There ___ four people here.","a":"are","w":["is","am","be"]},{"q":"___ there a bank near here?","a":"Is","w":["Are","Do","Does"]},{"q":"There ___ any milk left.","a":"isn't","w":["aren't","don't","doesn't"]},{"q":"___ there any questions?","a":"Are","w":["Is","Do","Does"]},{"q":"There ___ a lot of traffic today.","a":"is","w":["are","have","has"]}],"p":"\\bThere('s| is| are)\\b"},{"id":"g07","num":7,"lv":"A1","en":"Prepositions: in / on / at","ar":"حروف الجر: in / on / at","explain":["at للوقت المحدد والأماكن الصغيرة: at 5 o'clock, at the door.","on للأيام والتواريخ والأسطح: on Monday, on the table.","in للشهور والسنين والأماكن الكبيرة: in May, in 2020, in Cairo."],"formulas":[["at + exact time / point","at 8, at the station"],["on + day / surface","on Friday, on the wall"],["in + month / year / city","in July, in Egypt"]],"examples":[["The meeting is at nine.","الاجتماع الساعة تسعة."],["I'll see you on Friday.","هشوفك يوم الجمعة."],["She was born in 1998.","هي اتولدت سنة 1998."],["The keys are on the table.","المفاتيح على الترابيزة."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"I wake up in 6 o'clock.","r":"I wake up at 6 o'clock.","n":"الساعة المحددة مع at."},{"w":"See you in Monday.","r":"See you on Monday.","n":"الأيام مع on."}],"quiz":[{"q":"The class starts ___ nine.","a":"at","w":["on","in","to"]},{"q":"We meet ___ Sundays.","a":"on","w":["at","in","to"]},{"q":"I was born ___ June.","a":"in","w":["on","at","by"]},{"q":"He lives ___ Alexandria.","a":"in","w":["on","at","to"]},{"q":"The book is ___ the table.","a":"on","w":["in","at","from"]},{"q":"She arrives ___ noon.","a":"at","w":["on","in","to"]}],"p":"\\b(on|at) (the|\\w+day|noon|night|nine|ten|six|eight)\\b"},{"id":"g08","num":8,"lv":"A2","en":"Present continuous","ar":"المضارع المستمر","explain":["بنستخدمه للحاجة اللي بتحصل دلوقتي أو في الفترة الحالية: I am studying now.","الصيغة: am / is / are + الفعل + ing.","كلمات بتدل عليه: now, right now, at the moment, today."],"formulas":[["I am + verb-ing","I am reading"],["He / She / It is + verb-ing","She is cooking"],["We / You / They are + verb-ing","They are playing"]],"examples":[["I am studying English now.","أنا بذاكر إنجليزي دلوقتي."],["She is cooking dinner.","هي بتطبخ العشا."],["They are waiting outside.","هم مستنيين بره."],["Are you listening to me?","إنت بتسمعني؟"]],"mistakes":[{"w":"She cooking now.","r":"She is cooking now.","n":"لازم is قبل الفعل + ing."},{"w":"I am go to school.","r":"I am going to school.","n":"بعد am لازم الفعل + ing."}],"quiz":[{"q":"She ___ dinner right now.","a":"is cooking","w":["cooks","cook","cooked"]},{"q":"They ___ outside at the moment.","a":"are waiting","w":["waits","wait","waited"]},{"q":"I ___ to music now.","a":"am listening","w":["listen","listens","listened"]},{"q":"___ you studying today?","a":"Are","w":["Do","Does","Is"]},{"q":"He is ___ a book.","a":"reading","w":["reads","read","to read"]},{"q":"We ___ for the bus right now.","a":"are waiting","w":["is waiting","waiting","wait"]}],"p":"\\b(am|is|are) \\w+ing\\b"},{"id":"g09","num":9,"lv":"A2","en":"Past simple","ar":"الماضي البسيط","explain":["بنستخدمه لحاجة حصلت وخلصت في الماضي: I visited Cairo last year.","الأفعال المنتظمة بنزوّد ed: work → worked. وفيه أفعال شاذة لازم تتحفظ: go → went, see → saw, eat → ate.","في المنفي بنستخدم didn't + الفعل الأصلي، وفي السؤال Did + الفاعل + الفعل الأصلي."],"formulas":[["verb + ed","worked, played"],["irregular verbs","go → went, have → had"],["didn't / Did + base verb","I didn't go. / Did you go?"]],"examples":[["I visited my uncle yesterday.","زرت عمي امبارح."],["She went to the market.","هي راحت السوق."],["We didn't see the movie.","إحنا ماشفناش الفيلم."],["Did you finish the report?","خلصت التقرير؟"]],"mistakes":[{"w":"I goed to school.","r":"I went to school.","n":"go فعل شاذ ماضيه went."},{"w":"Did you went there?","r":"Did you go there?","n":"بعد Did الفعل في الأصل."}],"quiz":[{"q":"I ___ my friend yesterday.","a":"visited","w":["visit","visits","visiting"]},{"q":"She ___ to the market last week.","a":"went","w":["go","goes","gone"]},{"q":"We ___ the film. It was boring.","a":"didn't enjoy","w":["don't enjoy","didn't enjoyed","not enjoy"]},{"q":"___ you finish the work?","a":"Did","w":["Do","Does","Were"]},{"q":"He ___ a new phone last month.","a":"bought","w":["buy","buys","buyed"]},{"q":"They ___ dinner at eight yesterday.","a":"had","w":["have","has","haved"]}],"p":"\\b(went|bought|had|visited|stayed|spent|decided|started|finished|received)\\b"},{"id":"g10","num":10,"lv":"A2","en":"Future: will / going to","ar":"المستقبل: will و going to","explain":["will بنستخدمها للقرار اللحظي والوعود والتوقعات: I'll help you.","going to بنستخدمها للخطط اللي قررناها قبل كده: I'm going to travel next month.","بعد will الفعل في الأصل، وبعد going to الفعل كمان في الأصل."],"formulas":[["will + base verb","I will call you."],["am / is / are going to + base verb","She is going to study."],["will not = won't","I won't be late."]],"examples":[["I'll carry your bag.","هشيل شنطتك."],["We are going to visit Aswan.","إحنا هنزور أسوان."],["It will rain tomorrow.","هتمطر بكرة."],["I won't be late.","مش هتأخر."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"She will goes tomorrow.","r":"She will go tomorrow.","n":"بعد will الفعل في الأصل."},{"w":"I going to travel.","r":"I am going to travel.","n":"لازم am قبل going to."}],"quiz":[{"q":"It's cold. I ___ close the window.","a":"will","w":["am going","going to","would"]},{"q":"We ___ visit Luxor next month. We booked tickets.","a":"are going to","w":["would","won't","going"]},{"q":"She ___ be late. She promised.","a":"won't","w":["doesn't","isn't","don't"]},{"q":"I think it ___ rain tomorrow.","a":"will","w":["going","is","does"]},{"q":"Look at those clouds! It ___ rain.","a":"is going to","w":["will to","going to","does"]},{"q":"He ___ call you tonight.","a":"will","w":["will to","wills","going"]}],"p":"\\b(will|won't|going to)\\b"},{"id":"g11","num":11,"lv":"A2","en":"Comparatives & superlatives","ar":"المقارنة والتفضيل","explain":["عشان نقارن بين اتنين بنزوّد er للكلمات القصيرة (taller)، وبنستخدم more للكلمات الطويلة (more expensive)، وبعدها than.","عشان نقول \"الأكثر\" بنستخدم the + est أو the most: the tallest, the most beautiful.","كلمات شاذة: good → better → the best، و bad → worse → the worst."],"formulas":[["short adj + er + than","taller than"],["more + long adj + than","more expensive than"],["the + est / the most","the tallest, the most popular"]],"examples":[["My brother is taller than me.","أخويا أطول مني."],["This phone is more expensive than that one.","التليفون ده أغلى من ده."],["She is the best student in class.","هي أحسن طالبة في الفصل."],["Today is the hottest day.","النهاردة أحر يوم."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"more taller","r":"taller","n":"مش بنجمع more مع er."},{"w":"the most good","r":"the best","n":"good ليها شكل خاص: the best."}],"quiz":[{"q":"Cairo is ___ than Alexandria.","a":"bigger","w":["more big","biggest","big"]},{"q":"This book is ___ than that one.","a":"more interesting","w":["interestinger","most interesting","interesting"]},{"q":"She is the ___ student in class.","a":"best","w":["good","better","goodest"]},{"q":"Today is the ___ day of the year.","a":"hottest","w":["hotter","more hot","hot"]},{"q":"This road is ___ than the other.","a":"longer","w":["more long","longest","long"]},{"q":"He is ___ than his brother.","a":"taller","w":["more tall","tallest","tall"]}],"p":"\\b(more|most|better|best|\\w+er than|the \\w+est)\\b"},{"id":"g12","num":12,"lv":"A2","en":"Modals: can / must / should","ar":"الأفعال المساعدة: can / must / should","explain":["can للقدرة والإمكانية: I can swim. وللإذن: Can I come in?","must للإلزام القوي: You must wear a seatbelt. و should للنصيحة: You should rest.","بعد المودالز الفعل في الأصل من غير to ومن غير s: She can swim (مش can swims)."],"formulas":[["can + base verb","can swim"],["must / mustn't + base verb","must go / mustn't talk"],["should + base verb","should sleep"]],"examples":[["I can speak three languages.","أقدر أتكلم تلات لغات."],["You must stop at the red light.","لازم تقف عند الإشارة الحمرا."],["You should drink more water.","المفروض تشرب مياه أكتر."],["Can I use your phone?","ينفع أستخدم تليفونك؟"]],"mistakes":[{"w":"She can swims.","r":"She can swim.","n":"بعد can الفعل في الأصل."},{"w":"You should to rest.","r":"You should rest.","n":"من غير to بعد should."}],"quiz":[{"q":"She ___ speak three languages.","a":"can","w":["cans","can to","is can"]},{"q":"You ___ wear a seatbelt. It's the law.","a":"must","w":["should to","can to","may to"]},{"q":"You look tired. You ___ rest.","a":"should","w":["must to","can to","shoulds"]},{"q":"___ I use your phone, please?","a":"Can","w":["Do","Am","Must to"]},{"q":"He ___ swim, so he stayed away.","a":"can't","w":["don't","isn't","not"]},{"q":"You ___ talk during the exam.","a":"mustn't","w":["don't must","mustn't to","not must"]}],"p":"\\b(can|can't|must|should|mustn't)\\b"},{"id":"g13","num":13,"lv":"B1","en":"Present perfect","ar":"المضارع التام","explain":["بنستخدمه للحاجة اللي حصلت في الماضي ولها علاقة بالحاضر، أو للخبرات: I have visited Rome.","الصيغة: have / has + التصريف التالت للفعل (past participle): done, seen, been.","كلمات بتدل عليه: ever, never, already, yet, just, since, for."],"formulas":[["have / has + V3","I have finished"],["since + point in time","since 2020"],["for + duration","for two years"]],"examples":[["I have already eaten.","أنا أكلت بالفعل."],["She has lived here for five years.","هي ساكنة هنا من خمس سنين."],["Have you ever been to Italy?","عمرك رحت إيطاليا؟"],["We haven't finished yet.","لسه ماخلصناش."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"I have saw this film.","r":"I have seen this film.","n":"بعد have لازم V3: seen."},{"w":"She has lived here since five years.","r":"She has lived here for five years.","n":"المدة مع for، ونقطة البداية مع since."}],"quiz":[{"q":"I ___ already eaten lunch.","a":"have","w":["has","having","am"]},{"q":"She ___ lived here for five years.","a":"has","w":["have","is","did"]},{"q":"___ you ever been to Italy?","a":"Have","w":["Did","Has","Do"]},{"q":"We haven't finished ___.","a":"yet","w":["already","ever","since"]},{"q":"He has worked here ___ 2019.","a":"since","w":["for","from","at"]},{"q":"They have ___ the report.","a":"written","w":["wrote","write","writing"]}],"p":"\\b(have|has|haven't|hasn't) (\\w+ed|been|seen|had|lost|met|gone)\\b"},{"id":"g14","num":14,"lv":"B1","en":"First conditional","ar":"الشرط الأول","explain":["بنستخدمه للحاجة الممكن تحصل في المستقبل: If it rains, we will stay home.","الصيغة: If + المضارع البسيط، will + الفعل الأصلي.","ممكن نبدأ بـ will الأول من غير فاصلة: We will stay home if it rains."],"formulas":[["If + present simple","If you study"],["..., will + base verb","you will pass"],["unless = if ... not","Unless you hurry = If you don't hurry"]],"examples":[["If it rains, we will stay home.","لو مطرت هنقعد في البيت."],["If you study, you will pass.","لو ذاكرت هتنجح."],["I will call you if I have time.","هكلمك لو معايا وقت."],["If she comes, I will tell her.","لو جت هقولها."]],"mistakes":[{"w":"If it will rain, we stay home.","r":"If it rains, we will stay home.","n":"بعد if بنستخدم المضارع البسيط مش will."},{"w":"If you will study, you pass.","r":"If you study, you will pass.","n":"will في النتيجة بس."}],"quiz":[{"q":"If it ___ tomorrow, we will stay home.","a":"rains","w":["will rain","rain","rained"]},{"q":"If you study hard, you ___ pass.","a":"will","w":["would","did","are"]},{"q":"I ___ call you if I have time.","a":"will","w":["would","am","did"]},{"q":"If she ___ late, we will leave.","a":"is","w":["will be","would be","be"]},{"q":"We will miss the bus ___ we hurry.","a":"unless","w":["if","when","because"]},{"q":"If he ___ the keys, he will open the door.","a":"finds","w":["will find","found","find"]}],"p":"(\\bIf\\b.*\\b(will|won't)\\b|\\b(will|won't|'ll)\\b.*\\bif\\b)"}]}